Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 23:43:38 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] mdns: announce the sessions added before avahi was running

announce_rtpmidi() before the avahi client reaches AVAHI_CLIENT_S_RUNNING
finds no entry group: it keeps the announcement and says it will be
announced when connected, but setup_entry_group() never announced it.
With avahi-daemon started together with rtpmidid, the session was never
published. Announce what is kept once the entry group exists.

Upstream: not sent yet
---
 lib/mdns_rtpmidi.cpp | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/lib/mdns_rtpmidi.cpp b/lib/mdns_rtpmidi.cpp
index e28a9a6..64dfd75 100644
--- a/lib/mdns_rtpmidi.cpp
+++ b/lib/mdns_rtpmidi.cpp
@@ -351,6 +351,9 @@ void rtpmidid::mdns_rtpmidi_t::setup_entry_group() {
     ERROR("Name collision?");
     return;
   }
+  // Sessions announced before the client was running (avahi-daemon
+  // started at the same time) are published now
+  announce_all();
 }
 
 /// Asks the network mdns for entries.
